	(text "KALKULASI DIVIDER: R-total = 49,9k + 49,9k + 5,6k = 105,4k; rasio = 5,6/105,4\n= 0,05313. 45,0 V -> 2,391 V · 50,0 V -> 2,656 V · 54,0 V -> 2,869 V (semua\n< 3,1 V full-scale ADC 11 dB — asumsi #4 audit: attenuation wajib 11 dB).\nArus divider ~0,51 mA @54 V — fault node dibatasi intrinsik oleh 2x49,9k (audit).\nR20a/R20b = 0805 1% 150 V: masing-masing ~25,5 V (margin rating ~6x; resolusi\ntemuan M6 audit: 2x49,9k seri menggantikan 100k 0603 yang marginal).\nDeviasi rasio +0,19% vs kontrak 100k/5,6k -> diserap kalibrasi 3-titik §53\n(titik 45/50/54 V — TEST_PLAN §51)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 62 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9c9b0780-a19f-4d05-b325-aa73fe2a4c0f")	)
	(text "PENAMAAN NODE (DN-S3-02): task spec §5-S3 menyebut node pra-R22 sebagai\nVBAT_SENSE; nama itu SUDAH terpasang di pin GPIO34 sejak S2 (netlist proof).\nSolusi: node tap pra-R22 = VBAT_DIV (baru, class ANALOG); node pin GPIO34\n(pasca-RC) = VBAT_SENSE (kontrak §3.2, terpasang S2). TP_VBAT (S7) mengetuk\nVBAT_DIV — sesuai maksud 'pra-R22' task spec.\nR22 2,2k + C21 100nF = RC 220 us di sisi pin: anti-alias + proteksi transient;\nimpedansi sumber 2,2k memadai utk sampling ADC 11 dB (app note ESP32)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 92 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "897a957a-9503-4ab3-9903-b853689c3144")	)
	(text_box "04_BATTERY_ADC — pengukuran tegangan baterai via divider (S3).\nBAT+ (tap PRA-FUSE — net BAT+ = {J_BAT.1, F1.1, R20a.1}; bukti netlist di validasi)\n  -> R20a 49,9k -> R20b 49,9k -> [VBAT_DIV] -> R21 5,6k -> AGND;\n  [VBAT_DIV] -> R22 2,2k -> [VBAT_SENSE] -> GPIO34 (U1.6, sheet 02);\n  C21 100nF di pin GPIO34 (ke AGND).\nRasio 0,05313: 2,39-2,87 V utk 45-54 V (ADC 11 dB). Kalibrasi 3-titik §53.\nSemua resistor 1%; R20a/b 0805 150 V; R21/R22 0603; C21 X7R 25V 0603.\nNet baru: VBAT_DIV (ANALOG — DN-S3-02). TP_VBAT (S7) di VBAT_DIV (pra-R22)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 180 40)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "dd2fecdf-1776-4632-bb84-102fdd8512bc")
	)
